{
    "title": "Color Call Theme, Call Screen",
    "description": "Enhance your calling experience with our Color Call Theme, Call Screen app. The color phone application changes the incoming call screen, customizing the screen to make it unique and vivid.\r\n\r\nHighly customizable, but easy-to-use, with this color screen theme app, you can:\r\n- Personalize your call screen\r\n- Customize accept and decline buttons for call screen\r\n- Get flash alert for call\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Color call theme:\r\n- This is the flagship feature of the color phone screen app. Choose from a spectrum of photo, buttons or avatar of contact to create a customized backdrop for your incoming call screen.\r\n- Colorful and popular themes: Tons of beautiful, dynamic and stylish caller screens available to beautify your incoming call by the phone call screen app.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Customize Call Themes:\r\n- Personalize your colorful call screen with a diy call theme.\r\n- You can modify the appearance of buttons, sliders, and other call controls, making them more visually appealing and intuitive to use.\r\n- Preview DIY call screen before saving\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Flash alert for call\r\n- Be alerted to incoming calls with fun, LED flash notifications\r\n- Never miss an important call again, even in noisy environments or when your device is on silent mode.\r\n\r\nEasily customize call themes to your style, enjoy the call screen themes color phone app today to experience stylish and efficient calling with a range of added personalization features.\r\n\r\nIf you experience any issues or need our help about the flash call app, please contact us. Have a nice day!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enhance your calling experience with our Color Call Theme, Call Screen app. The color phone application changes the incoming call screen, customizing the screen to make it unique and vivid.<br><br>Highly customizable, but easy-to-use, with this color screen theme app, you can:<br>- Personalize your call screen<br>- Customize accept and decline buttons for call screen<br>- Get flash alert for call<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Color call theme:<br>- This is the flagship feature of the color phone screen app. Choose from a spectrum of photo, buttons or avatar of contact to create a customized backdrop for your incoming call screen.<br>- Colorful and popular themes: Tons of beautiful, dynamic and stylish caller screens available to beautify your incoming call by the phone call screen app.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Customize Call Themes:<br>- Personalize your colorful call screen with a diy call theme.<br>- You can modify the appearance of buttons, sliders, and other call controls, making them more visually appealing and intuitive to use.<br>- Preview DIY call screen before saving<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Flash alert for call<br>- Be alerted to incoming calls with fun, LED flash notifications<br>- Never miss an important call again, even in noisy environments or when your device is on silent mode.<br><br>Easily customize call themes to your style, enjoy the call screen themes color phone app today to experience stylish and efficient calling with a range of added personalization features.<br><br>If you experience any issues or need our help about the flash call app, please contact us. Have a nice day!",
